---
import Analytics from '../../components/Analytics.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import ShareBar from '../../components/ShareBar.astro';
import SiteSearch from '../../components/SiteSearch.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>The Five Men Who Signed Away Adventism — April 15, 1904 | SundayLaw.com</title>
  <meta name="description" content="On April 15, 1904, five men signed the Articles of Incorporation creating a corporate Adventist church — six months after Ellen White warned that entering any new organization would mean apostasy from the truth. Learn who they were and what they did.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://sundaylaw.com/1904-signers">
  <meta property="og:title" content="The Five Who Signed Away Adventism — April 15, 1904">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Five men. One document. April 15, 1904. The day the General Conference Corporation was incorporated — six months after Ellen White said it would mean apostasy.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://sundaylaw.com/images/sundaylaw/1904SDA2.jpg">
  <Analytics />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Crimson+Text:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #07000f; --bg-soft: #0d0018; --bg-card: rgba(20,5,35,0.85);
      --ink: #f8f1dd; --muted: #9ca3af; --gold: #d4a537; --gold-soft: #fcd34d;
      --amber: #f59e0b; --red: #ef4444; --red-soft: #fca5a5;
      --blue: #3b82f6; --blue-soft: #93c5fd;
      --line: rgba(212,165,55,0.22); --line-soft: rgba(212,165,55,0.12);
      --line-red: rgba(239,68,68,0.3); --line-blue: rgba(59,130,246,0.3);
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg); overflow-x: hidden; }
    a { color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
    a:hover { color: var(--gold-soft); }
    .top-stripe { height: 5px; background: linear-gradient(to right, #7f1d1d, #ef4444, #b45309, #ef4444, #7f1d1d); }
    .nav { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; background: rgba(7,0,15,0.96); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .nav-wrap { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .nav-row { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 22px; }
    .nav-row-top { gap: 28px; height: 62px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.08); }
    .nav-row-bottom { gap: 20px; height: 42px; font-size: 0.82rem; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none; }
    .nav-link { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; white-space: nowrap; transition: color 0.18s; }
    .nav-link:hover { color: var(--gold-soft); }
    .nav-cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 38px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 8px; background: #9f1239; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; text-decoration: none; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: #be123c; color: #fff; }
    .nav-bottom-link { color: rgba(156,163,175,0.8); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; transition: color 0.18s; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .nav-bottom-link:hover, .nav-bottom-link.active { color: var(--gold-soft); }
    .menu-btn { display: none; width: 40px; height: 40px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .mobile-nav { display: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 14px 22px 18px; background: rgba(7,0,15,0.97); }
    .mobile-nav.open { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
    .mobile-nav a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
    @media (max-width: 860px) { .nav-row-bottom { display: none; } .menu-btn { display: inline-flex; } .nav-link { display: none; } }

    .page { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 22px 100px; }

    /* HERO */
    .hero-banner { padding: 60px 0 44px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.1); }
    .indictment-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 18px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(127,29,29,0.35); border: 1px solid var(--line-red); color: var(--red-soft); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .hero-h1 { font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.8rem); font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .hero-h1 em { color: var(--red-soft); font-style: italic; }
    .hero-sub { font-size: 1.05rem; color: rgba(248,241,221,0.75); line-height: 1.85; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 28px; }
    .hero-date-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 28px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(127,29,29,0.25); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.35); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--red-soft); }

    /* SECTION */
    .sect { padding: 50px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.1); }
    .sect-eyebrow { display: inline-block; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--gold-soft); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .sect h2 { font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.2; }
    .sect-sub { font-size: 0.97rem; color: rgba(248,241,221,0.8); line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .sect-sub strong { color: var(--gold-soft); }
    .sect-sub em { color: var(--red-soft); }

    /* MEGA WARN */
    .mega-warn { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(127,29,29,0.3), rgba(7,0,15,0.9)); border: 2px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.4); border-radius: 20px; padding: 38px 36px; margin: 32px 0; text-align: center; }
    .mega-warn-eyebrow { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--red); margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .warn-date-pill { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(127,29,29,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.35); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--red-soft); margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .mega-warn blockquote { font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif; font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); font-style: italic; color: #fde8e8; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .mega-warn cite { font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(252,165,165,0.75); font-style: normal; font-weight: 600; }

    /* SIGNERS GRID */
    .signers-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin: 28px 0; }
    .signer-card { background: rgba(13,5,25,0.8); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px 18px; text-decoration: none; display: block; transition: all 0.22s; }
    .signer-card:hover { border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.4); transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(127,29,29,0.2); }
    .signer-num { font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--red); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .signer-name { font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.25; }
    .signer-loc { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .signer-role { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--gold-soft); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .signer-link { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--red-soft); font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }

    /* STEPS LIST */
    .steps-list { list-style: none; margin: 22px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
    .steps-list li { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 18px 20px; background: rgba(13,5,25,0.7); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: 12px; }
    .step-num { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(127,29,29,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--red-soft); flex-shrink: 0; }
    .step-text { font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgba(248,241,221,0.82); line-height: 1.75; padding-top: 5px; }
    .step-text strong { color: var(--red-soft); }

    /* IDEM STRIP */
    .idem-strip { background: rgba(30,58,138,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.25); border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px 28px; margin: 28px 0; }
    .idem-title { font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif; font-size: 1.7rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--blue-soft); margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .idem-compare { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: center; margin: 22px 0; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .idem-compare { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .idem-name { background: rgba(20,5,35,0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; }
    .idem-label { font-size: 0.68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .idem-val { font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--blue-soft); font-style: italic; line-height: 1.4; }
    .idem-vs { font-weight: 800; color: var(--red-soft); font-size: 1.1rem; text-align: center; }
    .idem-strip p { font-size: 0.93rem; color: rgba(248,241,221,0.8); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .idem-strip strong { color: var(--gold-soft); }
    .idem-strip a { color: var(--blue-soft); text-decoration: underline; }

    /* CONSTITUTION STRIP */
    .const-strip { background: rgba(30,58,138,0.1); border-left: 5px solid var(--blue); border-radius: 0 14px 14px 0; padding: 28px 28px; margin: 28px 0; }
    .const-label { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: var(--blue-soft); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .const-strip blockquote { font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif; font-size: 1.3rem; font-style: italic; color: rgba(147,197,253,0.9); line-height: 1.7; }
    .const-strip cite { font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgba(147,197,253,0.6); font-style: normal; margin-top: 10px; display: block; }
    .const-analysis { font-size: 0.93rem; color: rgba(248,241,221,0.8); line-height: 1.85; margin-top: 14px; }
    .const-analysis strong { color: var(--red-soft); }
    .const-gov-link { color: var(--blue-soft); text-decoration: underline; }

    /* TIMELINE */
    .timeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; margin: 24px 0; }
    .tl-item { display: flex; gap: 20px; padding: 0 0 28px 0; position: relative; }
    .tl-item::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 38px; bottom: 0; width: 2px; background: rgba(212,165,55,0.15); }
    .tl-item:last-child::before { display: none; }
    .tl-dot { width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(13,5,25,0.9); border: 2px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .tl-dot.red { border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.5); background: rgba(127,29,29,0.3); }
    .tl-year { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--gold-soft); }
    .tl-year.red { color: var(--red-soft); }
    .tl-content { padding-top: 6px; }
    .tl-title { font-size: 0.97rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .tl-desc { font-size: 0.87rem; color: rgba(248,241,221,0.72); line-height: 1.75; }
    .tl-desc strong { color: var(--gold-soft); }

    /* DOC PAIR */
    .doc-pair { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin: 24px 0; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .doc-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .doc-frame { border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.25); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; }
    .doc-frame img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
    .doc-caption { padding: 10px 14px; background: rgba(30,5,5,0.7); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--red-soft); line-height: 1.5; }

    /* RESOURCE GRID */
    .resource-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin: 22px 0; }
    .resource-card { background: rgba(13,5,25,0.7); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 16px; text-decoration: none; display: block; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .resource-card:hover { border-color: var(--line); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .resource-card-label { font-size: 0.68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .resource-card-title { font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gold-soft); line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .resource-card-desc { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* FOOTER */
    .site-footer { background: #04000a; border-top: 1px solid rgba(180,130,50,0.15); }
    .footer-banner { padding: 22px; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(127,29,29,0.15), rgba(127,29,29,0.08), rgba(127,29,29,0.15)); }
    .footer-banner p { font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif; color: #fde68a; font-size: 1.05rem; font-style: italic; }
    .footer-banner cite { color: var(--gold); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; display: block; margin-top: 5px; }
    .footer-main { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 44px 22px; display: grid; gap: 2rem; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .footer-main { grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; } }
    .footer-col h4 { color: var(--gold-soft); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .footer-col ul { list-style: none; }
    .footer-col li { padding: 4px 0; }
    .footer-col li a { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.875rem; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .footer-col li a:hover { color: var(--gold-soft); }
    .footer-bottom { border-top: 1px solid rgba(180,130,50,0.08); padding: 18px 22px; text-align: center; }
    .footer-bottom p { color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.78rem; }
    .footer-stripe { height: 4px; background: linear-gradient(to right, #7f1d1d, #b91c1c, #d97706, #b91c1c, #7f1d1d); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="top-stripe"></div>

  <nav class="nav" id="navbar">
    <div class="nav-wrap">
      <div class="nav-row nav-row-top">
        <a href="/" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-right:auto;">
          <img src="/images/shield_sundaylaw.com_the_final_warning_logo.jpg" alt="SundayLaw.com" style="height:38px;width:auto;display:block;border-radius:4px;" />
        </a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/1904-signers">The 5 Signers</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/april-15-1904-new-organization">1904 Record</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/religious-liberty">Religious Liberty</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/library">Pioneer Library</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="/loud-cry">Loud Cry &mdash; Rev. 18:4</a>
        <button class="menu-btn" id="menu-btn" aria-label="Open menu">&#9776;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-row nav-row-bottom">
        <a class="nav-bottom-link active" href="/1904-signers">All 5 Signers</a>
        <a class="nav-bottom-link" href="/1904-signers/arthur-g-daniells">Daniells</a>
        <a class="nav-bottom-link" href="/1904-signers/amos-p-needham">Needham</a>
        <a class="nav-bottom-link" href="/1904-signers/james-r-scott">Scott</a>
        <a class="nav-bottom-link" href="/1904-signers/harvey-edson-rogers">Rogers</a>
        <a class="nav-bottom-link" href="/1904-signers/daniel-k-nicola">Nicola</a>
        <a class="nav-bottom-link" href="/1860-name-selection">1860 Name</a>
        <a class="nav-bottom-link" href="/april-15-1904-new-organization">1904 Record</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mobile-nav" id="mobile-nav">
      <a href="/1904-signers">All 5 Signers (Index)</a>
      <a href="/1904-signers/arthur-g-daniells">Arthur G. Daniells</a>
      <a href="/1904-signers/amos-p-needham">Amos P. Needham</a>
      <a href="/1904-signers/james-r-scott">James R. Scott</a>
      <a href="/1904-signers/harvey-edson-rogers">Harvey Edson Rogers</a>
      <a href="/1904-signers/daniel-k-nicola">Daniel K. Nicola</a>
      <a href="/april-15-1904-new-organization">April 15, 1904 Record</a>
      <a href="/library">Pioneer Library</a>
      <a href="/loud-cry">The Loud Cry</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <div class="page">

      <!-- HERO BANNER -->
      <div class="hero-banner">
        <div class="indictment-badge">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
          The Apostasy Record &mdash; Washington, D.C.
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero-h1">The Five Men Who<br><em>Signed Away Adventism</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
          Six months after Ellen White warned that entering any new organization would mean
          <strong style="color:#fca5a5;">&ldquo;apostasy from the truth,&rdquo;</strong>
          five men gathered in the District of Columbia and signed the Articles of Incorporation
          creating the General Conference Corporation of Seventh-day Adventists.
          The pioneer movement was over. The corporate church had begun.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-date-badge">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
          April 15, 1904 &mdash; Takoma Park &amp; Washington, D.C.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- DOCUMENT EVIDENCE -->
      <div class="sect">
        <div class="sect-eyebrow">Primary Source Evidence</div>
        <h2>The Document They Signed</h2>
        <p class="sect-sub">
          The Articles of Incorporation were filed on April 15, 1904, and later published in the
          <strong>1905 Seventh-day Adventist Yearbook</strong> (pages 139&ndash;156).
          The document bears five signatures. Each man listed below signed his name to this act of apostasy.
        </p>
        <div class="doc-pair">
          <div class="doc-frame">
            <img src="/images/sundaylaw/1904SDA1.jpg" alt="Articles of Incorporation, April 15, 1904 — Page 1" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="doc-caption">Articles of Incorporation &mdash; April 15, 1904 &mdash; The document that created the corporate Adventist church</div>
          </div>
          <div class="doc-frame">
            <img src="/images/sundaylaw/1904SDA2.jpg" alt="Articles of Incorporation, April 15, 1904 — Page 2 — Signers" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="doc-caption">Page 2: Five signatures. Daniells first. The church now belongs to the state.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px;">
          <a href="/books/1904-image-of-papacy/seventh-day-adventist-yearbook-1905.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(212,165,55,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.3);color:var(--gold-soft);font-weight:700;font-size:0.88rem;">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
            1905 Yearbook PDF &mdash; pp. 139&ndash;156
          </a>
          <a href="/april-15-1904-new-organization" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.25);color:var(--red-soft);font-weight:700;font-size:0.88rem;">
            Full April 15, 1904 Evidence Page &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- EGW MEGA-WARNING -->
      <div class="sect">
        <div class="sect-eyebrow">The Warning They Rejected &mdash; October 1903</div>
        <h2>What Ellen White Said Six Months Before</h2>
        <p class="sect-sub">
          These five men did not act in ignorance. Ellen White had addressed the General Conference leadership
          directly in October 1903 &mdash; six months before April 15, 1904 &mdash; with an explicit warning
          about entering a new organization. Her words could not be misunderstood. They signed anyway.
        </p>
        <div class="mega-warn">
          <div class="mega-warn-eyebrow">&#9888; Ellen G. White &mdash; Letter 242 &mdash; Written October 1903</div>
          <div class="warn-date-pill">Six months before the April 15, 1904 signing</div>
          <blockquote>
            &ldquo;We have our Bibles. We have our experience, attesting to the truth of God&rsquo;s word,
            and <em>we cannot now enter into any new organization, for this would mean apostasy from the truth.</em>&rdquo;
          </blockquote>
          <cite>&mdash; Ellen G. White, 1SM 204 (Letter 242, October 1903)</cite>
        </div>
        <div style="background:rgba(127,29,29,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2);border-radius:14px;padding:24px 26px;margin-top:20px;">
          <p style="font-size:0.93rem;color:rgba(248,241,221,0.85);line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:10px;">
            The word <strong style="color:var(--red-soft);">&ldquo;apostasy&rdquo;</strong> is not a mild term. It means a complete rejection and betrayal of the faith &mdash;
            a turning from God&rsquo;s established order to a human system. This is the word Ellen White chose.
            She did not say it would be &ldquo;unwise&rdquo; or &ldquo;premature.&rdquo; She said it would be <em>apostasy.</em>
          </p>
          <p style="font-size:0.93rem;color:rgba(248,241,221,0.85);line-height:1.85;">
            In the same letter, she wrote: <strong style="color:#fde8e8;">&ldquo;The enemy of souls has sought to bring in the supposition that a great reformation was to take place
            among Seventh-day Adventists&hellip; The principles of truth that God in His wisdom has given to the remnant church, would be discarded.
            Their foundation would be built on the sand, and storm and tempest would sweep away the structure.&rdquo;</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- THE FIVE SIGNERS -->
      <div class="sect">
        <div class="sect-eyebrow">The Five Signatories &mdash; April 15, 1904</div>
        <h2>Five Men. One April Morning. One Act of Apostasy.</h2>
        <p class="sect-sub">
          The Articles of Incorporation list five signatories. Two groups: three from Washington, D.C. proper,
          and two from Takoma Park, Maryland (at the time still partly in Maryland jurisdiction).
          Each man held a position of authority and trust within the Adventist movement.
          Each betrayed that trust on April 15, 1904.
        </p>
        <div class="signers-grid">
          <a href="/1904-signers/arthur-g-daniells" class="signer-card">
            <div class="signer-num">Signer No. 1 &mdash; Takoma Park, MD</div>
